        },
        {
          "text": "“Abhaibhuri bhatagaacha guitöa gikugira ya abhaana bhaabho, na abhaana bhatagaacha guitöa gikugira ya abhaibhuri bhaabho, këra möntö aitöe gikugira ya amaraga gaae umuene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
